+// "scroll up eight" stays. The graph is carried as parallel arc arrays:
+//   num_states : state count; ids are 0..num_states-1.
+//   start      : start AND sole base accept state (every command-final arc
+//                returns here); normally 0.
+//   arc_from/arc_word/arc_to : `num_arcs` parallel arrays — one (from -> word ->
+//                to) transition each. `arc_word[i]` is a NUL-terminated word.
